WEBVTT

1

00:00:17.875 --> 00:00:20.083

You had your time, but it's over!



2

00:00:20.083 --> 00:00:22.333

Look above you, morons!



3

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:33.917

Where are Eren and Christa?



4

00:00:33.917 --> 00:00:35.583

It's no use!



5

00:00:35.583 --> 00:00:40.542

If you don't turn yourselves in, every last

Scout we captured will get the noose!



6

00:00:40.542 --> 00:00:43.417

I entrusted something to Commander Pyxis.



7

00:00:43.417 --> 00:00:46.083

When it comes, I will only watch.



8

00:00:46.083 --> 00:00:47.875

It's up to you to decide.



9

00:00:47.875 --> 00:00:50.375

You... and them.



10

00:02:34.917 --> 00:02:37.250

That sure is a lot of wagons.



11

00:02:38.250 --> 00:02:39.542

What's going on?



12

00:02:39.542 --> 00:02:41.167

You don't know?



13

00:02:41.167 --> 00:02:44.708

Right now, all the heads of the

military are meeting inside the castle



14

00:02:44.708 --> 00:02:47.625

to finally dismantle the Scout Regiment.



15

00:02:47.625 --> 00:02:48.708

See?



16

00:02:48.708 --> 00:02:52.375

There's the gallows for

hanging their commander.



17

00:02:52.375 --> 00:02:56.750

I bet it's ongoing as we speak...

his final judgment.



18

00:02:56.750 --> 00:03:03.000

If humanity loses the Scout Regiment,

that means humanity loses their spear.



19

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:09.208

When enemies close in, you guard not with a

shield, but a spear that eliminates the threat.



20

00:03:09.208 --> 00:03:14.208

Suppose now, if this instant,

Wall Rose were to be breached...



21

00:03:14.208 --> 00:03:19.542

The residents of Wall Rose would again

flee and take refuge in Wall Sina.



22

00:03:19.542 --> 00:03:25.458

But the earlier evacuation left stockpiles

with no more than a few days at best.



23

00:03:25.458 --> 00:03:31.333

In the blink of an eye, most of the residents

would be forced to fight for survival.



24

00:03:31.333 --> 00:03:38.625

Wall Rose and Sina... Humanity would be split

in two factions and civil war would erupt.



25

00:03:38.625 --> 00:03:45.042

Even if the wall was not breached, Wall Rose

is continually suffering a food shortage.



26

00:03:45.042 --> 00:03:48.500

It may not be Titans that breach Wall Sina...



27

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:53.417

There's a chance the residents

of Wall Rose do it first.



28

00:03:57.125 --> 00:03:59.417

Reclaim Wall Maria.



29

00:03:59.417 --> 00:04:04.333

If humanity is to ever hope for

a future, that is the only way.



30

00:04:04.333 --> 00:04:08.542

Are you implying that the Scouts

are needed for such a cause?



31

00:04:08.542 --> 00:04:13.125

Our duty as Scouts has always been

to charge forth at the enemy.



32

00:04:13.125 --> 00:04:17.083

Cowering away will not solve anything.



33

00:04:17.083 --> 00:04:23.000

Or could it be... you have some sort

of secret plan to overcome this ordeal?



34

00:04:29.167 --> 00:04:32.500

Erwin, I don't think you understand.



35

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:37.292

The reason you're here today is not

to discuss our future within the walls,



36

00:04:37.292 --> 00:04:41.250

nor is it because of something

as simple as murder.



37

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:43.250

Clause Six, Charter of Humanity.



38

00:04:43.250 --> 00:04:48.542

"Thou shall not prioritize one's own

gain over the longevity of humanity."



39

00:04:48.542 --> 00:04:50.958

You're here for this grave offense.



40

00:04:50.958 --> 00:04:55.625

Indeed. You've refused to hand

over Eren Jaeger multiple times.



41

00:04:55.625 --> 00:04:58.833

In doing so, you've violated the Charter.



42

00:04:58.833 --> 00:05:02.042

But Eren is vital for reclaiming Wall Maria!



43

00:05:02.042 --> 00:05:04.458

That is not for the Scouts to decide!



44

00:05:04.458 --> 00:05:07.958

Eren Jaeger is a Titan whose

powers are not understood!



45

00:05:07.958 --> 00:05:11.458

Sheltering him within the walls

is a risk to humanity!



46

00:05:11.458 --> 00:05:16.083

It's absurd for a single commander

to have control of him alone.



47

00:05:16.083 --> 00:05:19.875

And yet, you stubbornly persisted

in some plan of yours.



48

00:05:19.875 --> 00:05:24.500

Not only did you feign his abduction

and conceal Eren Jaeger...



49

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:28.125

...but you silenced Dimo Reeves

since he knew of your plans.



50

00:05:28.125 --> 00:05:30.208

This is clearly treason.



51

00:05:30.208 --> 00:05:35.208

It is not a stretch to say that

you're the threat to humanity.



52

00:05:35.208 --> 00:05:36.542

Commander Pyxis.



53

00:05:36.542 --> 00:05:37.542

Hmm?



54

00:05:37.542 --> 00:05:42.083

The Garrison and Scout Regiments

both risk their lives on the front lines.



55

00:05:42.083 --> 00:05:45.667

How are we to know that

you're not his comrade?



56

00:05:45.667 --> 00:05:50.542

I'm quite disturbed that you believe

we would align ourselves with the Scouts.



57

00:05:50.542 --> 00:05:54.250

Nothing is more senseless

than humans killing humans.



58

00:05:54.250 --> 00:06:00.542

In this cramped world that we humans have,

one spark will engulf all in no time.



59

00:06:00.542 --> 00:06:03.583

When it came time to defend Trost District,



60

00:06:03.583 --> 00:06:08.792

that's what I told my soldiers

before sending many to their deaths.



61

00:06:08.792 --> 00:06:14.500

If the Scout Regiment is that one spark,

it should be smothered at once.



62

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:20.500

After all, if the Titans do manage to break

the wall and find hardly anyone left inside...



63

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:23.583

...those poor Titans might go hungry.



64

00:06:25.208 --> 00:06:26.708

Very well.



65

00:06:26.708 --> 00:06:28.792

Allow us to discuss.



66

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:34.792

Your Majesty... May we?



67

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:46.042

Erwin... Is this how you want it to end?!



68

00:06:54.875 --> 00:06:59.250

In the name of the King,

I will announce your judgment.



69

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:01.333

Erwin Smith.



70

00:07:01.333 --> 00:07:07.083

For violating Clause Six of the Charter

of Humanity, you are sentenced to death.



71

00:07:09.125 --> 00:07:12.333

Your execution will be carried out immediately.



72

00:07:12.333 --> 00:07:13.750

Take him.



73

00:07:16.542 --> 00:07:19.458

Is this what you wanted, Erwin?!



74

00:07:25.875 --> 00:07:27.958

With this, you're...



75

00:07:42.708 --> 00:07:44.583

Wall Rose...



76

00:07:44.583 --> 00:07:46.375

...has been breached!



77

00:07:49.583 --> 00:07:51.708

The Colossal Titan appeared out of nowhere!



78

00:07:51.708 --> 00:07:56.917

Along with the Armored Titan, they broke

through both gates of Calaneth District!



79

00:07:56.917 --> 00:08:00.917

Currently, refugees from the East

are flocking here for safety!



80

00:08:01.958 --> 00:08:04.458

Establish a route for the evacuees!



81

00:08:04.458 --> 00:08:08.833

Have all Garrison troops

converge and defend the East!



82

00:08:08.833 --> 00:08:11.583

Get the evacuees safely to Wall Sina!



83

00:08:11.583 --> 00:08:15.333

Everyone, hurry! Saving the

evacuees is our top priority!



84

00:08:15.333 --> 00:08:15.917

--Sir!



85

00:08:15.917 --> 00:08:17.208

--No!

--Sir!



86

00:08:17.208 --> 00:08:18.208

Hmm?



87

00:08:18.208 --> 00:08:20.958

Close up all of the gates to Wall Sina!



88

00:08:20.958 --> 00:08:24.792

Don't let a single refugee inside!



89

00:08:24.792 --> 00:08:26.542

Huh?!



90

00:08:26.542 --> 00:08:31.125

B-But that's... all the Wall Rose residents.



91

00:08:31.125 --> 00:08:34.958

Your command is to sit back and

watch as half of humanity dies?



92

00:08:34.958 --> 00:08:38.708

It's just like he said earlier!

That's asking for civil war!



93

00:08:38.708 --> 00:08:42.833

We can't let the government lose control!

If that happens, it's over!



94

00:08:42.833 --> 00:08:46.875

B-But... That's only a mere possibility!



95

00:08:46.875 --> 00:08:49.667

It's enough for that possibility to exist!



96

00:08:49.667 --> 00:08:52.833

Our authority is and always will be absolute!



97

00:08:52.833 --> 00:08:54.875

Now, get moving!



98

00:09:02.208 --> 00:09:03.417

Shit...



99

00:09:03.417 --> 00:09:06.708

To think the wall would be

breached at a time like this...



100

00:09:06.708 --> 00:09:09.292

Though, there is a silver lining.



101

00:09:09.292 --> 00:09:11.667

We've already found the power.



102

00:09:11.667 --> 00:09:15.708

All that's left is to bide our time

until the vessel takes it.



103

00:09:15.708 --> 00:09:20.625

That's right. There's no need to be

flustered by this little disaster.



104

00:09:20.625 --> 00:09:23.583

As long as Wall Sina holds up, we'll be fine.



105

00:09:23.583 --> 00:09:26.625

Yes, once Lord Reiss comes back...



106

00:09:28.583 --> 00:09:30.917

Let's do it! Close the gates!



107

00:09:30.917 --> 00:09:31.833

Wait!



108

00:09:31.833 --> 00:09:33.875

It'll be too late if we wait!



109

00:09:36.333 --> 00:09:38.292

Who gets to choose?



110

00:09:38.292 --> 00:09:40.167

Who decides?



111

00:09:40.167 --> 00:09:42.542

What are you doing?! Hurry it up!



112

00:09:42.542 --> 00:09:45.208

It'll be treason if you don't!



113

00:09:47.542 --> 00:09:48.583

I will not!



114

00:09:48.583 --> 00:09:49.667

What?!



115

00:09:49.667 --> 00:09:50.958

Hey...



116

00:09:50.958 --> 00:09:54.958

I... am a human of Wall Rose!



117

00:09:54.958 --> 00:09:57.083

I will not allow the gates to be closed!



118

00:09:57.083 --> 00:09:58.000

You fool!



119

00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:00.333

I will stand behind him.



120

00:10:06.125 --> 00:10:09.625

Dhalis Zachary...



121

00:10:09.625 --> 00:10:14.917

Are you surprised at all by

their reaction, Premier Zachary?



122

00:10:14.917 --> 00:10:17.167

No... Not a bit.



123

00:10:17.167 --> 00:10:20.583

Zachary, what's the meaning of this?!



124

00:10:20.583 --> 00:10:23.375

That report just now was a false alarm.



125

00:10:23.375 --> 00:10:25.208

Rest assured.



126

00:10:25.208 --> 00:10:29.833

At the moment, there has been

no report of a Titan attack.



127

00:10:29.833 --> 00:10:32.208

You bastards! What is this farce?!



128

00:10:32.208 --> 00:10:35.250

If you want the mastermind, it's me.



129

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:37.000

Pyxis?!



130

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:41.333

It seems most of the Interior Police

are off somewhere or other.



131

00:10:41.333 --> 00:10:43.583

I suppose that's quite fortunate.



132

00:10:43.583 --> 00:10:44.833

What do you mean?!



133

00:10:44.833 --> 00:10:51.250

Earlier, I declared to you that the Garrison

Regiment isn't aligned with the Scout Regiment.



134

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:54.250

But I did forget to mention one thing...



135

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:57.750

I'm not aligned with any of you, either.



136

00:10:57.750 --> 00:11:02.167

While I do possess some of the

same feelings as Erwin here...



137

00:11:02.167 --> 00:11:05.375

...I considered leaving things

up to your government



138

00:11:05.375 --> 00:11:09.667

if that were the better choice

for the sake of humanity.



139

00:11:09.667 --> 00:11:16.042

You are, after all, much wiser than us

when it comes to Titans and the walls.



140

00:11:16.042 --> 00:11:20.875

Supposing you actually cared about

saving as many people as possible,



141

00:11:20.875 --> 00:11:24.833

I would have been fine

sending Erwin to the gallows.



142

00:11:24.833 --> 00:11:31.750

Of course, depending on your decision,

all of us were prepared to forfeit our heads.



143

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:36.542

However, the answer you've

given us is very clear!



144

00:11:36.542 --> 00:11:40.875

We may be ignorant about the Titans

and their powers, but...



145

00:11:40.875 --> 00:11:45.500

I daresay, we in our ignorance can save

far more people than you ever could!



146

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:50.042

Y-You're a fool! What do you think

undermining us will accomplish?!



147

00:11:50.042 --> 00:11:52.958

The citizens will never listen to you!



148

00:11:52.958 --> 00:11:55.792

They'll obey whatever the crown says!



149

00:11:55.792 --> 00:11:58.208

The regional lords will have none of this!



150

00:11:58.208 --> 00:12:01.667

It seems you don't quite understand.



151

00:12:01.667 --> 00:12:04.083

This is no mere threat.



152

00:12:04.083 --> 00:12:05.917

It's a coup d'état.



153

00:12:07.667 --> 00:12:11.083

We've successfully restrained

the Interior Police!



154

00:12:11.083 --> 00:12:12.333

Mmm.



155

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:20.708

The thing with soldiers, they'll obey

their superior officer over the king.



156

00:12:20.708 --> 00:12:23.750

Especially when the king in question is a fraud.



157

00:12:23.750 --> 00:12:27.208

We will put in place a new ruler of our own.



158

00:12:27.208 --> 00:12:30.667

It can't be... They're actually...



159

00:12:30.667 --> 00:12:33.542

Don't even think you can

get away with this hoax!



160

00:12:33.542 --> 00:12:36.125

If that disaster had in fact happened...



161

00:12:36.125 --> 00:12:41.625

The decision that all of you made violates

Clause Six of the Charter of Humanity.



162

00:12:41.625 --> 00:12:44.042

Furthermore, is installing a fake king



163

00:12:44.042 --> 00:12:48.708

to personally control and run the

government not punishable by death?



164

00:12:55.833 --> 00:12:57.792

Shit! Wake up, dotard!



165

00:12:57.792 --> 00:12:59.292

What? Time to eat?



166

00:12:59.292 --> 00:13:01.625

Shut up, you useless oaf!



167

00:13:08.625 --> 00:13:10.208

Erwin...



168

00:13:10.208 --> 00:13:12.083

This is your victory.



169

00:13:13.083 --> 00:13:14.875

Aren't you happy?



170

00:13:15.958 --> 00:13:17.833

Nile.



171

00:13:17.833 --> 00:13:23.167

Humanity has just begun down a new path...

One far more dangerous than before.



172

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:45.208

And there you have it.

The coup d'état was successful.



173

00:13:45.208 --> 00:13:49.667

Premier Zachary has control of

the capital and administrative district.



174

00:13:49.667 --> 00:13:53.125

For the time being, the nobility haven't rebelled.



175

00:13:53.125 --> 00:13:56.042

What about the Boss Reeves incident?



176

00:13:56.042 --> 00:13:59.292

We got a confession that proved

the charges unfounded.



177

00:13:59.292 --> 00:14:01.958

His son Flegel really pulled through big time.



178

00:14:01.958 --> 00:14:03.792

Don't you get it?!



179

00:14:03.792 --> 00:14:07.083

The government doesn't give

a shit about saving any of us!



180

00:14:07.083 --> 00:14:10.208

Face the truth now, because it'll be

too late when you're dead!



181

00:14:10.208 --> 00:14:15.958

That's right! If Titans attack us again,

there'll be nothing left this time!



182

00:14:15.958 --> 00:14:18.625

Not the company! Not our families!



183

00:14:18.625 --> 00:14:21.667

Let's print the truth before that happens!



184

00:14:23.083 --> 00:14:28.625

Just like it's written right there, it shows the

charges were bogus, they abused their power,



185

00:14:28.625 --> 00:14:32.167

and that King Fritz was a total fake.



186

00:14:32.167 --> 00:14:35.792

All our actions were justified self-defense.



187

00:14:35.792 --> 00:14:39.542

In other words, we're free people now.



188

00:14:42.875 --> 00:14:47.125

Woohoo!



189

00:14:47.125 --> 00:14:50.667

No... This can't be...



190

00:14:50.667 --> 00:14:52.958

Looks like the gamble paid off.



191

00:14:52.958 --> 00:14:54.458

Yeah.



192

00:14:54.458 --> 00:14:57.000

It wasn't just Erwin though.



193

00:14:57.000 --> 00:15:01.125

The lone choices of many

managed to change the world.



194

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:07.625

And I managed to kill the

three people you loaned me.



195

00:15:07.625 --> 00:15:09.125

I'm sorry.



196

00:15:12.083 --> 00:15:18.833

The thing is, part of the Interior Police, their

leader, Eren, and Historia are somewhere else.



197

00:15:18.833 --> 00:15:21.042

If we don't find them soon...



198

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:25.208

I may have a clue about that.



199

00:15:25.208 --> 00:15:28.583

Let's get there and put an end to this battle.



200

00:15:28.958 --> 00:15:33.958

"Underground Chapel"

"A sacred location where the royal family's power

has been passed down for generations. The walls

are composed of a naturally luminescent ore."



201

00:15:36.042 --> 00:15:38.875

As a result of Erwin's actions,



202

00:15:38.875 --> 00:15:42.750

it was declared that the current

regime would be ousted.



203

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:45.208

That announcement came immediately after



204

00:15:45.208 --> 00:15:48.583

the military gained control of the

capital and administrative district.



205

00:15:48.583 --> 00:15:54.208

And took place upon the gallows

constructed specifically for him.



206

00:15:54.208 --> 00:15:55.667

That's right.



207

00:15:55.667 --> 00:15:59.167

It's exactly how Premier Zachary

explained in the speech.



208

00:15:59.167 --> 00:16:03.417

Understand that our goal

is not to establish military rule.



209

00:16:03.417 --> 00:16:07.500

In place of Fritz, a new ruler will

come from the true royal family.



210

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:10.417

They will be the one responsible

for leading the people.



211

00:16:10.417 --> 00:16:12.375

I understand that well enough,



212

00:16:12.375 --> 00:16:17.250

but do you really think people will simply

accept a new ruler just like that?



213

00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:20.625

There're a lot of citizens out

there who are very worried.



214

00:16:20.625 --> 00:16:23.708

At this point, who do we trust?



215

00:16:25.625 --> 00:16:31.625

As far as humanity's concerned, we should

have let the government do as they please.



216

00:16:31.625 --> 00:16:33.667

Like Commander Pyxis was saying,



217

00:16:33.667 --> 00:16:38.292

they've somehow devised a means

of keeping humanity alive until now.



218

00:16:38.292 --> 00:16:44.208

Even if they watch as half of humanity dies,

it's better than us going extinct.



219

00:16:46.583 --> 00:16:52.958

Should I have let Eren go, risked my comrade's

lives, given up both my life and my duty,



220

00:16:52.958 --> 00:16:55.917

and entrusted it all to the government?



221

00:16:55.917 --> 00:17:00.042

If humanity is more precious

than one single life...



222

00:17:03.583 --> 00:17:06.917

Your duty is as painful as ever.



223

00:17:06.917 --> 00:17:10.083

Dying seems a far easier option.



224

00:17:11.458 --> 00:17:15.833

In that case, why didn't you do as you said?



225

00:17:15.833 --> 00:17:16.792

That's...



226

00:17:16.792 --> 00:17:19.958

Shall I tell you my reason?



227

00:17:19.958 --> 00:17:23.083

For a long time, I've hated those bastards!



228

00:17:23.083 --> 00:17:23.750

--Huh?



229

00:17:23.750 --> 00:17:25.458

--They piss me off!

--Huh?



230

00:17:25.458 --> 00:17:28.958

Those pompous pricks and pigs

who think they're important...



231

00:17:28.958 --> 00:17:32.500

No... Maybe I actually liked them.



232

00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:36.042

I've been dreaming for

this day to come for ages.



233

00:17:36.042 --> 00:17:42.083

That is... Even if you hadn't done it, I would've

given it a shot before I kicked the bucket.



234

00:17:42.083 --> 00:17:48.083

I couldn't care less if this coup d'état

is good or bad for humanity.



235

00:17:48.083 --> 00:17:50.917

I'm quite the scoundrel, right?



236

00:17:50.917 --> 00:17:53.833

But you're no different than me.



237

00:17:54.833 --> 00:17:57.917

You didn't want to die.



238

00:17:57.917 --> 00:18:04.500

Just like me, you prioritize yourself

over the fate of humanity.



239

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:08.667

I... must be very conceited to think that.



240

00:18:08.667 --> 00:18:11.375

What's your reason?



241

00:18:11.375 --> 00:18:14.292

Now it's your turn to answer.



242

00:18:16.458 --> 00:18:18.583

I...



243

00:18:18.583 --> 00:18:21.250

...have a dream.



244

00:18:21.250 --> 00:18:23.750

One I've had since I was a child...



245

00:18:34.333 --> 00:18:36.000

Hange.



246

00:18:36.000 --> 00:18:38.042

You might know where they are?



247

00:18:38.042 --> 00:18:41.000

Yeah, I'll explain.



248

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:45.417

Erwin gave me this Scout investigation

report regarding Lord Reiss' land.



249

00:18:45.417 --> 00:18:50.417

Most of it has to do with an incident five

years ago that shook up the Reiss family.



250

00:18:50.417 --> 00:18:51.667

Five years ago?



251

00:18:51.667 --> 00:18:55.792

Right. On the day Wall Maria was breached.



252

00:18:55.792 --> 00:18:59.250

I'll summarize the important

bits from the beginning.



253

00:18:59.250 --> 00:19:05.042

As the lord of his territory, popular opinion

of Rod Reiss wasn't all that bad.



254

00:19:05.042 --> 00:19:10.500

He had five children, and his eldest

daughter Frieda was a down-to-earth girl



255

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:13.792

that even the peasants adored.



256

00:19:13.792 --> 00:19:17.667

But that night, five years ago, disaster struck.



257

00:19:17.667 --> 00:19:21.083

With the world having plunged into pure chaos,



258

00:19:21.083 --> 00:19:25.958

some bandits raided and set fire

to the only chapel around.



259

00:19:25.958 --> 00:19:31.958

Unfortunately, that night, the entire

Reiss family was there praying together.



260

00:19:31.958 --> 00:19:38.042

And so, the whole family, save for

the head of the house, Rod Reiss...



261

00:19:38.042 --> 00:19:41.625

...was massacred that night by the bandits.



262

00:19:43.750 --> 00:19:48.583

To top it off, this incident occurred

just a few days before Historia's mother



263

00:19:48.583 --> 00:19:51.125

was killed by the Interior Police.



264

00:19:52.625 --> 00:19:58.792

In other words, immediately after losing

his family, Rod Reiss sought out Historia.



265

00:19:58.792 --> 00:20:03.708

There must be a reason he

and his lackeys are after Historia.



266

00:20:03.708 --> 00:20:05.917

The same bloodline?



267

00:20:05.917 --> 00:20:08.542

Is there some secret to their blood?



268

00:20:08.542 --> 00:20:10.917

I don't know for sure yet.



269

00:20:10.917 --> 00:20:16.292

But what really makes me curious is that

parts of the chapel were completely wrecked.



270

00:20:16.292 --> 00:20:22.083

The chapel itself is stone. It would take

tons of time and effort to destroy it.



271

00:20:22.083 --> 00:20:25.333

Bandits would take what they can

and make a quick escape.



272

00:20:25.333 --> 00:20:30.417

Plus, the only one who saw those

bandits was Rod Reiss himself.



273

00:20:30.417 --> 00:20:34.917

Soon after, he used his own

fortune to rebuild the chapel.



274

00:20:34.917 --> 00:20:36.375

But why?



275

00:20:40.875 --> 00:20:46.625

If you think about it, it's actually stranger

that there were no traces of Titans.



276

00:20:46.625 --> 00:20:54.292

Even if I'm jumping to conclusions, something

this suspicious deserves us checking it out.



277

00:21:18.167 --> 00:21:19.750

What the hell?!



278

00:21:29.458 --> 00:21:34.583

Before the night is over,

we'll have soldiers all over Reiss' land.



279

00:21:34.583 --> 00:21:38.917

Unfortunately, I doubt

he'll be waiting that long.



280

00:21:38.917 --> 00:21:43.917

If we don't hurry and get there,

Eren may end up being eaten.



281

00:21:46.625 --> 00:21:52.917

If a Titan eats a person who can change into

a Titan and thus inherits their powers...



282

00:21:52.917 --> 00:21:55.875

If that's actually true...



283

00:21:55.875 --> 00:22:02.417

When and how did Eren become a Titan,

and who did he eat to gain his powers?



284

00:22:08.917 --> 00:22:10.333

Shit!



285

00:22:21.875 --> 00:22:23.875

Historia?



286

00:23:57.917 --> 00:24:02.500

To save Eren, Mikasa and the

others head for the Reiss chapel.



287

00:24:02.500 --> 00:24:05.458

However, the captured Eren finds out...



288

00:24:05.458 --> 00:24:10.042

...his father, Grisha's, unforgivable sin.



289

00:24:10.042 --> 00:24:12.096

Next episode: "Sin."

